                    <strong>⚠️ Risk of destroying your SDR — @Model.Settings.RadioModel has no IF tap.</strong>
                    Because this radio has no rear-panel IF output, an SDR has to be connected to an antenna port.
                    <strong>Transmitting on that antenna (or any antenna nearby) will deliver enough RF energy
                    into the SDR's front end to damage or destroy it.</strong> Either use a dedicated receive-only
                    antenna for the SDR, fit a coax switch that disconnects the SDR during TX, or fit a
                    transmit/receive RF relay or PIN-diode T/R switch. Do not transmit with the SDR's coax
