                            blank if that VFO has no SDR.
                        </div>

                        <label for="sdrDeviceDropdownA" class="form-label small fw-semibold mb-1">VFO A SDR</label>
                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm mb-1" id="sdrDeviceDropdownA">
